Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our primary objective this\Ntime around was to find you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, and I'm so glad we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could head back but I have a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that might\Nbe worth sticking around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Labyrinth Stratum a bit\Nlonger for if you're game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm game?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, this mission came as a humble\Nrequest from the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They want our help in defeating\Nthe Skeletitan stratum lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one we ran into before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't considering\Ndefeating it originally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it does present a danger\Nto hunters if left unchecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, bearing that in mind, I for one feel\Nit's my duty to help them if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear is a consummate leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagine it'd be prudent to let the\NMenagerie make their case as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said it, but I like explaining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we want to defeat\Nthis Stratumlord guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we think that with your help,\Nwe've got a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like, have you met the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I get that it's\Na big-time undertaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since I love explaining,\NI'll tell you this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every member of the Menagerie\Nof Fools has a personal goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're resolute about achieving\Nthese goals, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if that means people\Ntreat us like fools,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calling us a menagerie as\Nif we're a bunch of animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard the\Nlegend of the labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It holds that anyone who reaches the\Ndungeon, the labyrinth's lowest level,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and manages to meet its requirements,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will be granted any wish they make.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.19,0:02:12.52,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.04,0:02:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.00,0:03:15.96,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,1)\fscx58}The Flame Skeletitan of the Labyrinth Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People may have reached the lowest level,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to this day, no one has\Nconquered the dungeon yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one knows what the requirements are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what we're after, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Requirements, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor is there's not so little\Ncatch about those wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they can only be granted\Nif you have one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coins that drops when you\Ntake down a Stratum Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the eight-legged crocodile\Ncoin I have in my inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew it was worth all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that the Menagerie of\NFools consists of eight members.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The twins have the same wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vice captain and I also share\None, so that makes six wishes total.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already got three\Nof those coins between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.38,0:03:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I could use my coin to\Nhave a wish granted too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should become a super\Nhigh-performance vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or not, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And according to Hulemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got a human soul buried\Nsomewhere in that Boxxo body of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you work with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any reason you couldn't\Nput that soul back into a human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tease, you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember stumbling across a situation\Nlike that in a book once upon a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxxo in human form, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate the save there, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, we gotta get to the lowest\Nlevel before we'll get any wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, to beef up our abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're hitting all the strata, keeping\Nears to the ground for news about lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finding them, and taking them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you defeated the\Neight-legged crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did one of those coins I mentioned appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you have it on you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best news I've heard in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suboxo Lamas, you're officially\Ninvited to join the Menagerie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't have to sign\Non for every quest or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're welcome to work with us on\Ncampaigns when we need some extra help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in, but what about Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we could talk for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you could even try my cooking, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, twist my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll work with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Boxxo, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to join this ship of fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck yes, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with Boxo along for the ride, we'll\Nnever have to worry about food, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought of campaigning\Njust got a whole lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to being human? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a human body, I could\Nprobably feel their warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't you all look\Nprepped and ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we get our bearings, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pun intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the new map?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't call that\Naccurate even to be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could share my security\Ncamera images with him somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I could use this function.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the labyrinth stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, how'd you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, are you somehow able to\Nshow us all the things you've seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite an impressive feat, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who's getting a bonus\Nfrom the Hunters Association?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this makes the\Napproach a little easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how to defeat the Stratum\NLord, the Flame Skeletitan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just up ahead of us, there's a rather\Nsizable trap waiting to be sprung,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it only activates under very\Nspecific conditions. Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are weight-related.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything above a certain weight\Nwill trigger the trap's door,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which opens to a cavernous\Nhole in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We once tried to march a large group through\Nthis stratum and paid the price for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you might have surmised, we'll drop\Nthe Flameskeletitan into that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hole big enough for\Nthat thing to fit into?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cavernous indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly do you plan to get a stratum,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord, to fall for a\Ntrap in its own stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll use its expertise against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Skeletitan won't\Nactivate the trap on its own,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll just have to do it manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's why we put this campaign\Ngroup together with quality over quantity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why\NKarios and Gorth are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These two are a lot more\Nskilled than your average guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:08:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone, stay\Nclose to the left-hand wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By close, I mean backs up against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closely now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you take in the\Nexact placement of the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, time for my favorite\Nthing, a detail of explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole is over twice as deep\Nas the flame skeleton is tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We plan to lure it to right on top\Nof the hole and let it fall in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if that works, we doubt\Nit'll be enough to finish it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna attack it from up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. Thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if we attack from above,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fire all over its body will\Nmelt everything we throw at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm thinking we could make\Nuse of the Vice Captain's water magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,combined with some water from Box Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fill the hole before we dump\Nthe big fiery guy in. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the plan is to extinguish the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exposing the bone like we\Nwould with flame skulls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then inflict as\Nmuch damage as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it even possible to\Nsell or dispense enough
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.62,0:09:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water to implement the\Nplan we're proposing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can dispense bottled water, but it'll\Ntake days to dispense enough to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vending machine's sole purpose\Nis to provide for its customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll add a function.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:31.55,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\move(325,-5,325,175)}Refreshing\N{\c&H3810B5&\fs10} Mr. Pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's yet another shape\NI've never seen Boxo make before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I take it we can interpret\Nthis change as your answer, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.26,0:09:50.48,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\frz-9.95\pos(221,115)\fax0.18\fs12}Refreshing\N{\c&H3810B5&\fs14}Mr. Pressure
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.26,0:09:50.48,sign_13627_129_Refreshing__Mr__,text (small black; to the left),0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\c&H1C1C18&\frz-4.57\fax0.18\pos(253,235)}Coin-Op\N Power\N Washer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there are multiple extensions now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which leads me to believe each of them\Nserves a different function when you push it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much like punching in different\Nnumbers to buy different items.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some pictures here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.44,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz5.47\fax-0.1\pos(96,55)}Insert Payment
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.44,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz5.47\fax-0.1\pos(220,43)\fsp.1}Choose Settings
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.44,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz5.47\fax-0.1\pos(335,30)\fscx90}Activate Trigger
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.44,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\frz5.47\fax-0.1\fscx66\pos(436,20)}Replace When Done
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they tell you how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squeeze this lever and it will\Ndispense water. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up, Vice Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so enjoy you ordering me to pay for\Nthings when you never open your own purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, folks, ready for blast-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could easily extinguish\Na flame skull, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that rate of flow, filling the\Nhole will take days, but it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but there's just one little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can change forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can only maintain the\Nnew one for two hours a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been two days since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For just one hour each day, I turn\Ninto a power washer and spray water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At other times, I have them\Nthrow in bottled water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it's been thrown, I do\Naway with all the bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.44,0:11:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things like huge hog fiends and flame\Nskulls have shown up several times,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're no threat for a\Ngroup of this skill level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When flame skulls appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas puts me on her back\Nand Shui gleefully douses
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fiery foes with the\Nsprayer to take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, time to find out\Nhow much water's collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep a firm grip on the lifeline, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, didn't expect it to be as\Ncold as midwinter down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like this ground drains\Nbetter than we anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't collected at\Nall. I see. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a good plan, but we're\Ngoing to have to modify.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dropping it in the pit should still\Nwork, but as for the rest of the plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it needs massaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good drainage, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, does this mean you've got an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey now, I see where you're headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's so cold down there, we can\Nfill it with ice instead of water.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.99,0:12:03.95,sign_14158_138_Insert_Payment,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\fs8\move(215,107,215,192)\frz-7.29\fax0.12\fscx65\fay.01}Automatic Ice Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My speed has increased, so I'm able\Nto produce the ice cubes much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know, I'm skeptical.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is an ice water bath going to be\Nenough to defeat the stratum horde?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, what you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something I can help you with? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you've noticed\Nor not, but when you're thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your lighting flickers a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even actually\Nwant to be human again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else would think that's\Na no-brainer, but not Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows me too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I did want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I would enjoy being able to\Nhave real conversations with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, a scary thought haunts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I weren't a vending machine,\Nwould my friends still value me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would I be worth to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, my sense of value is clear\Nbecause of all I can do for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I went back to being human...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, I'm sure\Nthey'd be happy at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once they saw what they'd\Nlost by my transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they might start wishing I was\Nstill a magic vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie, thoughts\Nlike that terrify me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't bring myself\Nto acquire the Telepathy function.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how it might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.84,0:13:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pathetic is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sad sack soul has more confidence\Nas a vending machine than a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that you're not sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times like these make me wish we could\Ntalk about all kinds of things, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and like I said before, I\Nreally want you to try my cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be human again, and Lamas\Nand I will walk hand in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that alone is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several more days went by.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pits collected quite a bit of ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's finally time to\Nput the plan into motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, how do you think\Nthings look, honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the plan have a chance of success?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem pretty confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.28,0:14:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Flame Skeletiton's fire\Ncan vaporize water instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wonder if ice\Nis going to be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Mikenne! Now! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reaction will release a\Nrush of steam, so watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water should have vaporized by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skeleton's fire! It went out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what went down,\Nbut if the fire's out, it's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to start throwing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flames were extinguished,\Nbut there's no steam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who knows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I was chucking into\Nthe hole wasn't ice at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was dry ice, and dry ice is\Nessentially solidified carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when the flame's skeleton fell in,\Nthe hole filled with carbon dioxide gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire can't burn without oxygen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and carbon dioxide collects at the bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since it's heavier than oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, it put out the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing my plan worked, because\Nif it had failed, we'd have been screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.80,0:16:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikenne, how's it look down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.98,0:16:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's taking\Na fair amount of damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're gonna need to hit harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we want this to be over anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how we could hit it harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd take something big and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo would make the perfect\Nweapon in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't work, he might\Nbreak or even be totally destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was fine after falling\Nthrough a stratum split.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was worse than this. Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can you guys stop talking\Nabout doing something
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so dangerous with me\Nlike I'm not right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't force Boxo into danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially since there's\Na chance it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.58,0:16:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I vote no, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it'd be cruel to put\Nany further burden on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we jump in and rush the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:17:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the flames\Nextinguished, we could win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pit is full of carbon dioxide gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go down there and you\Nwon't have enough oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will all die of\Ncarbon dioxide poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, seems Boxo agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Flame Skeletiton's trying\Nto climb out of the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we can't afford to\Nmiss this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys ready to win this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't act fast, my\Nfriends could all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be some way to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, why are you changing forms again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.74,0:17:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody needs stuff like that right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.16,0:17:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a pervert, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:17:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12 damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Durability has been decreased by 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.18,0:18:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I managed to finish it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.72,0:18:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming down to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell us it's\Nstill dangerous down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(150,60)}Investigate
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(120,105)}Sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(120,155)}Conserve Power
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(120,205)}Inspect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(120,250)}Goods
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\bord4\an4\pos(150,298)\3c&HF7F1F2&}Inventory
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (left window; top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(205,345)}Status
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.74,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (right window),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(350,78)\fs14}Eight-Legged Crocodile Coin
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.24,0:19:01.20,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (new entry),0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(350,125)\fs14\fsp3.4}Flame Skeletitan Coin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:19:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flame Skeletitan Coin was added\Nto my list of possessions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mikenne, shut the hole, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would we have done\Nif you had broken, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.98,0:19:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I'm mad at you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, cut the guy\Na little slack, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No sense punishing a friend for a good\Ndeed, unless you want him to be mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just mad because I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more crazy stunts like that, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't answer yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it meant saving everyone,\NI'd do it again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I didn't want to make a promise I\Ncouldn't keep, especially not to Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, she smiled an\Nexasperated smile at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys done talking\Nbecause I have an important
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,question for you tell me\Ndid the stratum lord's coin
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happen to drop while you\Nwere down in that hole hello
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there oh you even picked it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up for me how kind hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's the big idea hula\Nme you're trying to claim
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reward like there's no\Nquestion that it's yours but
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,boxo defeated the flame\Nskeleton which means you're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not the rightful owner of\Nthis coin sorry guess you're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right about that it'd be\Nwrong to deny that everything
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worked out because of your\Nexploits box so you were
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this coin fair and square\Nwith your heroics and I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would never take that right\Nfrom you so how about this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me buy it off you how\Ndoes a hundred gold coin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sound did he say a hundred\Ngold coins converted into
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,points that's a hundred\Nthousand heck yes you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.82,0:21:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hmm that's about the going\Nright for stratum lord coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I can vouch that he's\Noffering you a square deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, Boxxo. What'll it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is that fair and square,\Nit's an embarrassment of riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I already have one Stratum Lord\Ncoin, so I don't need another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd agree, Boxo, but I'm\Nglad you didn't waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind if I pay you another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little bit cash poor at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's head for home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, now for the journey back\Nto the Clear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like all I'll get\Nto see at the Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stratum is the view from the\Nsky in these main avenues.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:22:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I probably won't\Nsee this place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but this moment I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:23:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always hungry.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs29\pos(370,298)\fscx84}A Less-than-Ideal Hero
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

